id: 2026-08-01-000124-bioszen-2-1-0-available
title: BIOSZEN 2.1.0 Available
message: BIOSZEN 2.1.0 improves stability, adds editable PowerPoint graphic downloads, and is now available from R-universe. Install it from the link below, then launch it from RStudio Addins or with BIOSZEN:::BIOSZEN().
